flowchart LR
    Client[Web or mobile client] --> Edge[TLS proxy and rate limits]
    Edge --> API[FastAPI modular monolith]
    API --> Auth[JWT and object authorization]
    API --> ORM[SQLAlchemy request session]
    ORM --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    API --> Logs[Privacy-safe structured logs]
    API -. OTLP export to configure .-> Obs[Metrics, traces and alerts]
    DB --> Backup[Encrypted managed backups]
    Worker[Future durable job worker] -. async jobs .-> DB
